The plate looks like a compostable paper plate, probably about 20 cm across (roughly 260 px in the image). It holds about 22 grapes, mostly red with a few green. A grape here is about 40 px long, which is roughly 3 cm if 13 px is about 1 cm, so these are fairly large grapes of around 5-6 g each.

22 grapes × 5.5 g ≈ 120 g. At about 0.69 kcal/g, that comes to roughly 85 kcal.

